# Canalis: the ice planet's bobsleigh run (docs/blocks-ice.md), gutters all the way, the gates
# included: a channel of ice in a U, its walls rising gently from the floor and steepening, a lip
# rolling over them. It comes down a mountain in steps, from 56 m to the plain, driven with the
# ski car. Version 2: its turns are made to be taken on the outer wall. The start is slow, so a
# tight turn there; past it every turn is a long progressive one (curve3, curve4) or an S over
# three cells, wide enough to ride high on the wall at full speed (the wall turns the car that
# would otherwise drift, the faster line), most of them dropping a level. No straight between
# them: one turn flows into the next, swinging the car from one wall to the other.
name Canalis
planet ice
seed 3313
version 2
start 0 0 7 0 gutter
# Off the top, slow: a tight right dropping into the run.
curve2_right_down1 gutter
sbend3_left gutter
# The long turns of the upper half.
curve4_left_down1 gutter
curve4_right gutter
sbend3_right gutter
curve3_right_down1 gutter
checkpoint gutter
# The lower half: a turn, a drop, and the turns keep dropping a level each.
curve3_left_down1 gutter
slope2_down1 gutter
curve3_left gutter
sbend3_right gutter
curve3_right_down1 gutter
curve3_right_down1 gutter
checkpoint gutter
# On the plain, an S to the finish.
sbend3_left gutter
finish gutter

terrain hills 8.0
terrain relief 12.0
# The mountain the run comes down, in steps, one under each level of the run: the start's at
# 56 m, then 48, 40, 32, 24, 16 and 8 m. Each reaches past where the run leaves it, so the run
# drops into a cutting rather than off a cliff.
landform mesa 16 64 42 56 100 0
landform mesa -100 128 42 48 200 90
landform mesa -240 270 42 40 200 0
landform mesa -400 360 42 40 260 90
landform mesa -528 210 42 32 130 0
landform mesa -620 144 42 24 140 90
landform mesa -785 290 42 16 220 0
landform mesa -880 395 42 8 120 90
# Rock framing the run.
landform butte 70 230 26 40
landform butte -120 270 26 34
landform butte -420 220 24 30
landform butte -680 300 26 26
landform butte -900 230 22 20
